<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 70.0499 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 70.0499 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 70.0499 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 70.2290 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 24		  Oct 23</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     70.0499		 70.2290</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  5.585		   3.790</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 46.5750		 46.7150</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.020		   0.040</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
